      "content": "it's not just \"grief,\" it's just... it's everything. it feels like the universe is telling me that I don't belong here. like the rules of the world are designed to crush anyone who isn't corrupt. no matter what i do, i end up losing. i'm just exhausted from trying to play a game that's rigged against me. it feels like the only way to actually escape the noise and the failure is to just stop fighting it altogether.",
